# ⚠️ AN ADS TEST BENCH, NOT A RELEASE. The file carries forciblySetPlatformId —
# it FORCES the SDK to pretend it is a platform. It is needed to run the live ads
# branch for the first time BEFORE uploading to the portal (otherwise the first
# execution in history of the code that brings money would happen on live
# players). But shipped into a release it would lie to the platform and to the
# players. Hence: committing it is impossible PHYSICALLY, not by agreement.
# How to use it — WORKSTREAMS, the INTEGRATION block.
