# ⚠️ The itch.io hit-animations SOURCE pack (flashyfeather, hit-animations-vol2): 33 MB of
# 4096px sheets. The game embeds a REPACKED subset built by tools/hitfx-pack.py into
# src/app/37-hitfx.js — today eight effects at 192 px (the size and the list are the tool's
# arguments and have already changed twice; read the tool, not this line, for the live numbers).
# The raw pack must not enter the public repo — the licence covers use in a game, not the
# redistribution of the assets.
